      "atomic batch = all-or-nothing (P:verdict-completeness-transforms-and-conflict-rejection; D-atomic-batch-abort decided, JSON:API / AIP-233 shape): the one-verdict-per-mutation bijection (I-5) holds IFF the batch succeeds",
      "the batch inserts a NEW row e2 (would stamp seq 3) then updates e1 under a precondition; device-b claimed e1 first (seq 2, unseen by this client) so the precondition mismatches and the update is the offender",
